        "@value": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\\n\\n(1) Any loaded firearm(s).\\n\\n(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\\n\\n(3) Any unauthorized explosive or incendiary.\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"object\":\"\",\"scope_text\":\"In checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any unauthorized explosive or incendiary.\",\"typed_values\":[]}",
