670c6bcc41d4a\",\"quote\":\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"start\":2059},{\"end\":2105,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:2088:2105:sha256-d37f1b3411738f35d2f9e0d1ec9dfcc353c624367c0e413d025135b13dae3a2c\",\"quote\":\"does not prohibit\",\"start\":2088},{\"end\":2291,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:2059:2291:sha256-a31581aba563017ba66278b6c67ef76bae96945bec1063ae465670c6bcc41d4a\",\"quote\":\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"start\":2059},{\"end\":2291,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:2059:2291:sha256-a31581aba563017ba66278b6c67ef76bae96945bec1063ae465670c6bcc41d4a\",\"quote\":\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"start\":2059}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:13a07317ee79936f2512d746acc3d1f51551a7dd3c61483a01b24c309cd32d6a\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1c2488521bb5f05216aa2e154aa5bbc4d6011a330b9e549d294d9f137c2548af\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not prohibit\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:5f326db56527622b6723c086fd4fea8bf295296d785830ba78e6e1c1ecbf871e\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"references\":[\"49 CFR part 175\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:eb7e6e6971c4a99b629fd17231a8d258639e8e92193384f54fe254113beebb9c\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\"],\"scope_text\":\"In checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":2059,\"summary\":\"Section 1540.111 does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm, while Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
